\description{
Several objects in this package — \link[=length-class]{length}, \link[=weight-class]{weight},
\link[=maturity-class]{maturity}, \link[=naturalmortality-class]{naturalmortality}, \link[=fecundity-class]{fecundity}, and the fleet
sub-objects \link[=selectivity-class]{selectivity}, and \link[=retention-class]{retention} — share a common structure for specifying
